#: flowing.ScriptTool.args_model:1 flowing.tool.ScriptTool.args_model:1 of
msgid ""
"参数声明：Pydantic ``BaseModel`` 子类，声明即模型——LLM schema 由 "
"``model_json_schema()`` 派生、执行校验即模型本身；``None`` 时由 "
"``_infer_from_execute(self.execute)`` 从签名构建模型。"
